&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo is where careers accelerate. We move fast, think boldly, and empower you to do the best work of your life. You’ll be surrounded by teammates who care deeply, challenge each other, and celebrate wins. With tools that amplify your impact and a culture that backs your ambition, you won’t just contribute. You’ll make things happen–fast.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll do:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide day-to-day operational coverage across the delivery systems—help service teams ship, investigate deploy issues, keep the shared packages and ingress layer in good shape, and respond when something needs attention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement features, fixes, and improvements in &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript/Node (NestJS)&lt;/strong&gt; on the delivery systems and in &lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt; on the automation platform, with code review and support from senior engineers on the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our infrastructure-intelligence tooling and &lt;strong&gt;MCP&lt;/strong&gt;/agentic automation that provisions, updates, and audits infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within our &lt;strong&gt;ArgoCD&lt;/strong&gt; / &lt;strong&gt;Helm&lt;/strong&gt; / &lt;strong&gt;GitHub Actions&lt;/strong&gt; delivery model—declarative changes, safe rollouts, and clean rollbacks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software engineering experience, or equivalent, ideally with some exposure to infrastructure, platform, or backend/services work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Go or TypeScript/JavaScript&lt;/strong&gt;, and a genuine willingness to become productive in the other. The delivery systems are &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript/Node (NestJS, in an Nx monorepo)&lt;/strong&gt;; the automation platform is &lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;. You write clear, tested, maintainable code and are eager to grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good engineering fundamentals—building and consuming APIs, debugging, testing, version control, and reasoning about how a change affects others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some hands-on experience with—or strong eagerness to learn—&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes (K8s)&lt;/strong&gt;, cloud providers (&lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt; and/or &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;), and CI/CD tooling like &lt;strong&gt;GitHub Actions&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Helm&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in (or some exposure to) the GitOps model—declarative, Git-driven deployment with tools like &lt;strong&gt;ArgoCD&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, communicative style, and comfort learning an unfamiliar production system—asking good questions and learning before changing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Temporal&lt;/strong&gt; (or other workflow engines), or &lt;strong&gt;MCP / agentic AI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any hands-on work with GitOps tooling (&lt;strong&gt;ArgoCD&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Helm&lt;/strong&gt;) or a self-service deployment platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open-source infrastructure, CD, or developer-tooling projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-RA1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo (NASDAQ: GTM) is the Go-To-Market Intelligence Platform that empowers businesses to grow faster with AI-ready insights, trusted data, and advanced automation. Its solutions provide more than 35,000 companies worldwide with a complete view of their customers, making every seller their best seller.&lt;/p&gt;
